he newest from-car PID 2F read with timestamp + source, warning not block when stale; Mode $06 limit wording (max vs min) — and list the rest as not done. 2. Run at most 10 suites: check_mods, check_system_page, check_mil, check_dossier_view, check_bench, check_jobs_page, check_tests_page, check_scan_health, check_screens, check_live_ingest. Fix real regressions. 3. Commit \"Integration: Modifications tab wired, network event view, MIL from stored PID, live reads as scan sessions, fuel gate with source, Mode 06 limit wording\" with the Co-Authored-By line; push; restart cuore (MSYS_NO_PATHCONV=1 powershell -NoProfile -ExecutionPolicy Bypass -File C:/Users/User/mcp-servers/start-cuore.ps1 -Restart -Page /); confirm /api/health and 200 on /v/ZASFAKPN5J7B88115 job, mods, health, scans, codes, report, and the network system page. Report hash, what was kept/reverted, and what remains."},"uuid":"125596e5-9f6c-4de7-bf62-a14a29ebcd31","timestamp":"2026-10-14T15:31:34.553Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\User\\mcp-servers","sessionId":"7cb02eb5-e299-4baf-b34b-9eb82aebbf17","version":"2.1.282","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"binary-splashing-comet"}
